	)
	(text "CHANNEL BANK (8 channels) - this sheet is used twice\nChannelBankA: CH1-8,  U501/C501, Channels 6xx, Continuity 7xx\nChannelBankB: CH9-16, U801/C801, Channels 9xx, Continuity 10xx\n\n74HC595: QA..QH -> Channel 1..8, QH' -> Shift Register Chain\n  Bank A: SER = IO4, chain -> SER of Bank B\n  Bank B: chain -> IO1 (readback)\nSRCLK / RCLK shared, /SRCLR tied to 3.3 V, 100n decoupling\n/OE = Channel Enable (10k pull-up on root -> outputs OFF at boot)\nSense Enable -> mux /EN, MUX Supply -> mux VDD\n8-channel build: fit only bank A and close JP101 (root)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
